            },
            "reviewBody": "This cake is DELICIOUS! I have been looking for a cake with a rich chocolate flavor and this is it! I was never much of a chocolate fan because the flavor of chocolate never seems present. This cake has great texture and the flavor is great before the addition of the frosting.",
